flowchart TD
  A["Venus QuickJS：单条可见、打开回执或点击已收到"] --> B["读取 `message.participant-receipts`、`message.timeline`、`message.thread-detail` 完整 VM"]
  B --> C["Frame 内 `ActionBinding(post_read/template_received)` / `HostObservation`"]
  C --> D["native 注入 actor/requestId/observedRevision/surfaceEpoch"]
  D --> E["ActionInvocationEnvelope / HostObservation / Inbound"]
  E --> F["MobileImSdk -> CoreBridge -> helix-driver-ffi"]
  F --> G["`Tick::Command/Inbound/PortReply/Timer`"]
  G --> H["`http_write`、`storage_upsert`、`projection`"]
  H --> I["Go authority：`POST /api/cses/post/read` body `{channelId,posts:[postId]}`"]
  I --> J["WS/PortReply：`post_read`"]
  J --> K["`PersistAtomic -> PersistOk`；SQLite `message_receipt`"]
  K --> L{"PersistOk?"}
  L -- "否" --> X["保留旧 VM；ActionReceipt failed；可重试"]
  L -- "是" --> M["SurfaceComposer：`message.participant-receipts`、`message.timeline`、`message.thread-detail`"]
  M --> N["InteractionFrameV2 schemaVersion=2"]
  N --> O["FFI batch -> C++ SurfaceRuntime 整帧校验"]
  O --> P{"epoch/revision/causation 合法?"}
  P -- "否" --> Y["保留最后一致 VM；请求 snapshot/resync"]
  P -- "是" --> Q["原子提交 ParticipantReceiptsVm + TimelineWindowVm + ThreadDetailVm"]
  Q --> R["QuickJS im.surface.view/pending"]
  R --> S["移动 UI：读者列表、当前消息读态和线程详情一致；HostObservation 不直接伪造已读成功"]
  S --> T["FrameApplied / directive ack / action terminal"]
